# Play release notes format

When the owner asks for **Google Play release notes** (Internal, Closed, Production, or any track), always answer with **both** locales in this exact wrapper — ready to paste:

```text
<fr-FR>
…notes en français…
</fr-FR>
<en-US>
…notes in English…
</en-US>
```

## Constraints

- Each language block: **under 500 characters** (Play Console limit).
- Lead with `RackTrack X.Y.Z` and a one-line intent (e.g. internal test / production).
- User-facing, concise; no git SHAs or CI jargon.
- Do not wrap the blocks in Markdown code fences unless the owner asks for a fenced copy.
- Default languages are **fr-FR** then **en-US**; add other locales only if requested.
